{"explanation":"MasterKey creates versioned current-lifecycle records using the approved EncryptedKey cipher-preparation contract and derives the AES wrapping-key representation required for that lifecycle. It continues to derive and use the original PBKDF2 SecretKey for legacy records, selected from the persisted EncryptedKey lifecycle version, so pre-migration MasterKey records remain decryptable without changing MasterKey's persisted format or public API.","review_assumptions":["EncryptedKey.prepareEncryptionCipher(SecretKey) and EncryptedKey.encrypt(Cipher, SecretKey) throw no checked exceptions beyond MasterKey's existing constructor/generate exception contract, as required for compatibility with their existing callers.","The current lifecycle's AES wrapping key is the PBKDF2 output bytes represented as an AES SecretKeySpec; legacy records continue to require the provider-produced PBKDF2 SecretKey representation.","SecretKeySpec copies the supplied encoded key bytes; the temporary byte array may therefore be wiped immediately after construction."],"no_change_required":false,"decision":"MULTI_FILE_FIX_PROPOSED_FOR_REVIEW","confidence":"medium","edits":[{"source_file_path":"mobile/src/main/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/encryptor/MasterKey.java","original_code":"import java.io.IOException;
import java.security.InvalidAlgorithmParameterException;","edit_kind":"declaration","corrected_code":"import java.io.IOException;
import java.security.InvalidAlgorithmParameterException;
import java.util.Arrays;","reason":"Import Arrays to wipe the temporary PBKDF2 output copy used to construct the current AES wrapping-key representation.","symbol":"MasterKey imports"},{"source_file_path":"mobile/src/main/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/encryptor/MasterKey.java","original_code":"import javax.crypto.BadPaddingException;
import javax.crypto.IllegalBlockSizeException;","edit_kind":"declaration","corrected_code":"import javax.crypto.BadPaddingException;
import javax.crypto.Cipher;
import javax.crypto.IllegalBlockSizeException;","reason":"Import Cipher because new MasterKey records must be encrypted through EncryptedKey's prepared current-lifecycle cipher path.","symbol":"MasterKey imports"},{"source_file_path":"mobile/src/main/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/encryptor/MasterKey.java","original_code":"    private MasterKey(PBEKeySpec spec) throws NoSuchAlgorithmException,
            IllegalBlockSizeException, InvalidKeyException, BadPaddingException,
            NoSuchPaddingException, InvalidKeySpecException, IOException {
        SecretKeyFactory skf = getSecretKeyFactory();
        SecretKey pwd = skf.generateSecret(spec);

        byte[] raw = new byte[pwd.getEncoded().length];
        new SecureRandom().nextBytes(raw);
        SecretKey key = new SecretKeySpec(raw, "AES");

        mEncryptedKey = EncryptedKey.encrypt(pwd, key);
        mIterations = spec.getIterationCount();
        mAlgorithm = skf.getAlgorithm();
        mSalt = spec.getSalt();
    }","edit_kind":"method","corrected_code":"    private static SecretKey currentWrappingKey(SecretKey legacyWrappingKey) {
        byte[] encoded = legacyWrappingKey.getEncoded();
        try {
            return new SecretKeySpec(encoded, "AES");
        } finally {
            if (encoded != null) {
                Arrays.fill(encoded, (byte) 0);
            }
        }
    }

    private MasterKey(PBEKeySpec spec) throws NoSuchAlgorithmException,
            IllegalBlockSizeException, InvalidKeyException, BadPaddingException,
            NoSuchPaddingException, InvalidKeySpecException, IOException {
        SecretKeyFactory skf = getSecretKeyFactory();
        SecretKey pwd = skf.generateSecret(spec);

        byte[] raw = new byte[pwd.getEncoded().length];
        new SecureRandom().nextBytes(raw);
        SecretKey key = new SecretKeySpec(raw, "AES");
        SecretKey wrappingKey = currentWrappingKey(pwd);
        Cipher cipher = EncryptedKey.prepareEncryptionCipher(wrappingKey);

        mEncryptedKey = EncryptedKey.encrypt(cipher, key);
        mIterations = spec.getIterationCount();
        mAlgorithm = skf.getAlgorithm();
        mSalt = spec.getSalt();
    }","reason":"Create new MasterKey records with an AES wrapping key and the approved prepared-GCM cipher path, while retaining the PBKDF2-derived key material for compatibility selection during decryption. The temporary encoded-key copy is wiped after SecretKeySpec construction.","symbol":"MasterKey constructor and current wrapping-key conversion"},{"source_file_path":"mobile/src/main/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/encryptor/MasterKey.java","original_code":"    private SecretKey decrypt(PBEKeySpec spec) throws NoSuchAlgorithmException,
            InvalidKeySpecException, IllegalBlockSizeException, InvalidKeyException,
            BadPaddingException, InvalidAlgorithmParameterException, NoSuchPaddingException,
            IOException {
        SecretKeyFactory skf = SecretKeyFactory.getInstance(mAlgorithm);
        SecretKey pwd = skf.generateSecret(spec);
        return mEncryptedKey.decrypt(pwd);
    }","edit_kind":"method","corrected_code":"    private SecretKey decrypt(PBEKeySpec spec) throws NoSuchAlgorithmException,
            InvalidKeySpecException, IllegalBlockSizeException, InvalidKeyException,
            BadPaddingException, InvalidAlgorithmParameterException, NoSuchPaddingException,
            IOException {
        SecretKeyFactory skf = SecretKeyFactory.getInstance(mAlgorithm);
        SecretKey pwd = skf.generateSecret(spec);
        SecretKey wrappingKey = mEncryptedKey.usesCurrentWrappingKey()
                ? currentWrappingKey(pwd)
                : pwd;
        return mEncryptedKey.decrypt(wrappingKey);
    }","reason":"Select the current AES wrapping-key representation only for versioned current EncryptedKey records; preserve the original PBKDF2-derived SecretKey path for legacy records and their retained cipher parameters.","symbol":"MasterKey decrypt"}],"manual_review_required":true,"provided_contracts":["MasterKey.generate retains its public signature and produces new records through EncryptedKey.prepareEncryptionCipher(SecretKey) followed by EncryptedKey.encrypt(Cipher, SecretKey).","MasterKey decryption selects the current AES wrapping-key representation only when EncryptedKey.usesCurrentWrappingKey() is true, retaining the PBKDF2-derived legacy-key path otherwise."],"required_contracts":["EncryptedKey must provide package-private prepareEncryptionCipher(SecretKey), encrypt(Cipher, SecretKey), and usesCurrentWrappingKey() methods with checked exceptions compatible with MasterKey's existing public generate contract.","EncryptedKey must continue to decrypt legacy records with their retained transformation, algorithm identifier, and encoded parameters.","The dedicated EncryptedKey instrumentation test must exercise MasterKey-generated current records and representative legacy PBKDF2-wrapped records."],"source_file_path":"mobile/src/main/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/encryptor/MasterKey.java","required_tests":["In the coordinated EncryptedKey instrumentation test, verify that MasterKey.generate followed by decrypt returns the generated key for the correct password.","In the coordinated EncryptedKey instrumentation test, verify decryption of a representative legacy MasterKey/EncryptedKey record through the PBKDF2-derived legacy wrapping-key path."]}
